                  "content": "Featuredとregularが同じ背景・余白・角丸を反復し、同じheader構造を使う。写真と期間のサイズ差だけでは「今見直す対象」の特別さが弱く、使用期間の一覧に読める。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Tshpv",
                  "name": "Recommendation",
                  "fill": "#20242A",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Z2を推す理由とZ4のトレードオフ",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 20,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "NuEeM",
                  "name": "Recommendation details",
                  "fill": "#20242A",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Z2は対象 → 状態と目標との差 → 使用期間と目標 → 割合・日額 → 既存Detailの順。写真は認識の補助に留め、通常アイテムを囲わない軽い行へ。Z4は全体が軽くなる一方、Featuredの境界と優先度はZ2より弱い。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "WBLY6",
                  "name": "Convergence",
                  "fill": "#20242A",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "6方向 → 3系統 → 2系統",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 20,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "F101e",
                  "name": "Discarded rationale",
                  "fill": "#20242A",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "X3: 現行の延長。X4: 文章依存。X6: 所有期間の鑑賞に寄る。Y3: 簡略化後にOpenとの違いが縮小。Z1: 期間を先に読む性格が残る。数字の整列はZ2/Z4へ吸収。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "JHtLE",
                  "name": "Constraints",
                  "fill": "#20242A",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "実装に渡す境界",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 20,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "v5yDqS",
                  "name": "Constraint details",
                  "fill": "#20242A",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Product purpose・Featured選定順は現行を維持。Featuredはregularへ重複表示しない。1件時はregular見出しを隠す。写真/代替アイコンは1:1、写真はaspectFit。全項目3ptバー、100%上限＋実割合表示。100%超も使用中。Historyは末尾リンク。「使用メモ・コストを確認」は既存Item Detailへの同じ遷移。新画面・直接編集は追加しない。\n\n状態・目標との差を色や太字で過度に強調しない。状態とprogressは判断材料の一つで、アプリが買い替えの結論を出すものではない。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "i1CYJJ",
                  "name": "Validation",
                  "fill": "#20242A",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "確認済みと実装時に残る検証",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 20,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "UbOXP",
                  "name": "Validation details",
                  "fill": "#20242A",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "現行baseline: iPhone 17 Pro / iOS 26.5 runtime、変更前コードのbuild成功。候補: Pen.devでJP/EN、Light/Dark、0/83/95/100/133%、写真あり/なし、1/4件、長名、幅375pt、文字135%近似を確認。大文字は縦積み、名前や数値を省略せずスクロールで対応。iOS Dynamic Type、VoiceOver、実タップ領域、scroll/navigationは実装時に確認する。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
